  "ingredients": [
    "1 (5 pound) fully-cooked, bone-in ham",
    "0.25 cup maple syrup",
    "2 tablespoons Dijon mustard",
    "1 tablespoon red wine vinegar",
    "1 tablespoon dry mustard"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W23qoqIenMbxZFQ3I8G3lvHTAKQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/102677-Baked-Ham-with-Maple-Glaze-ddmfs-step-1-321-45f7b5c1e6d44edd8b669258f4ecb393.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/102677/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim excess fat off ham; score in a diamond pattern with a sharp knife, making shallow cuts about 1-inch apart. Place in a roasting pan. Roast in the preheated oven for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qhW8mK6tDCvlV7BW5eVlDa9DBnU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/102677-Baked-Ham-with-Maple-Glaze-ddmfs-step-2-323-6edb7c82bc2448dab27a7424ad7c7462.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/102677/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, whisk maple syrup, Dijon mustard, red wine vinegar, and mustard powder together in a small bowl until glaze is well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AhOpiOXIrgQjXgXtC1xddCv4ZGQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/102677-Baked-Ham-with-Maple-Glaze-ddmfs-step-3-324-53b9b2d63de64e07b4f1a015cac059f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/102677/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove ham from the oven. Brush 1/3 of the glaze over ham.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k864K7jKCIFcAbGIAoDGpjlpIcE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/102677-Baked-Ham-with-Maple-Glaze-ddmfs-step-4-333-c33b91e0312d441dbbd8019b5641c350.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/102677/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return ham to the oven and bake for 20 minutes more; glaze ham twice during this time. Let ham stand before carving for 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zIbRz1kSLxLp4utLsinA5slXHX0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/102677-Baked-Ham-with-Maple-Glaze-ddmfs-step-5-395-2b6131fb404647a8ac3ae062f02fa5be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/102677/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
